OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain, occasionally heavy, and
OL,6,Fstrong winds persist through the day
OL,7,Falong western coasts. Dull, cloudy and
OL,8,Ffeeling cold further east with some
OL,9,Fspells of light rain. A brisk breeze
OL,10,Finitially, strong at the coast, all
OL,11,Feasing through the day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain in the west eases and
OL,14,Fpushes away through the night leaving
OL,15,Fovercast skies for many with some
OL,16,Fpatchy drizzle. A chilly night with a
OL,17,Ftouch of frost possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
