OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,6,Fthe odd patch of light rain possible
OL,7,Fin the morning. Sunny spells becoming
OL,8,Fmore prevalent by afternoon. Feeling
OL,9,Fcold in the gentle easterly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FCloudy and frosty on Thursday,
OL,13,Falthough some morning sunshine too. A
OL,14,Fwet and windy start to Friday, before
OL,15,Fturning drier by afternoon. Some
OL,16,Fbrighter spells Saturday morning
OL,17,Fbefore rain returns.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
